ind":"update","title":"Update 0.16.2","summary":"Hello everyone! urgent patch cause one player decided to broke the game with a glitch (oopsie)Bug fixes:Fixed a bug where Fractal would duplicate itself in the discard when used with a Fast keyword.Fixed a bug where the deck list would not disappear immediatly when selecting a card during fusion.Fixed a few bugs related to French translation.QoL:Added a flag to give you a positive event for your first ever event on each saves.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T10:08:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114032022","verified_at":"2026-10-22T15:03:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4212830-1847286114029176","game_id":"steam-4212830","kind":"update","title":"Update 0.16.1","summary":"UPDATE 0.16.1Hello everyone, we are halfway in the Fest, here's a small patch for a few problems related to the demo! Enjoy!Full patch note:Bug fixes:Fixed a bug where Function would give you the same cheat if used twice in a row.Fixed a bug where Vuln immune and Weak immune were considered not in the demo.Fixed a bug where the enemy vulnerable mult would not be reset after each run.Fixed a bug where two shop screens could overlap each others.Fixed a bug where the glitchy ui would not be complet","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T15:06:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114029176","verified_at":"2026-10-21T17:14:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4212830-1846651706690824","game_id":"steam-4212830","kind":"announcement","title":"The Steam Next Fest starts now!","summary":"The Steam Next Fest starts now!Hello everyone and welcome to the Steam Next Fest. This week promises to be full of surprises and stupid cards!This devlog have a lot to cover, a new character for the demo, a contest to win a free key…But first, what is Void Nebula (or VN) for the newcomers?What is Void Nebula?Void Nebula is a sci-fi roguelike deckbuilder game with a focus on sandbox elements and chaotic customisation.Your goal is to beat 8 waves of 3 enemies while upgrading your cards. Each enemy","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T15:38:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690824","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4212830-1846018067930782","game_id":"steam-4212830","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo 0.15.3 is out!","summary":"Hello everyone! 0.15.3 is here!This should be the last patch before the Steam Next Fest patch, the demo version of this next patch will add more content to the demo!0.15.3 is a small update featuring mostly bug fixing, balance and QoL in preparation for the Fest. The demo needs to be as good as possible!ChangelogQoL:Added a button to swap the two cards in the fusion tool.The enemy attack is now green or red depending of if the attack was altered by any status effects.Shop buttons are now disable","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T17:16:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067930782","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4212830-1844115010495144","game_id":"steam-4212830","kind":"update","title":"0.15.1 update is out!","summary":"0.15.1 PatchHello everyone! This small patch is adding a few balance changes, QoL and other stuff that the demo players noticed, thank you for the crazy launch by the way!Changelog:New content (Playtest only):ItemsAdded Monochrome CloverAdded Parallel ProgramCheatsAdded Fission ReactorQoL:Added more visual cues for the shop special tools buttons to hint the new players to use them.Added a new sound and animation for glass card breaking.Added a separator between the text and rules of a status.You","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-18T15:09:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010495144","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4212830-1843481262701959","game_id":"steam-4212830","kind":"update","title":"THE VOID NEBULA DEMO IS OUT (also update 0.15.0)","summary":"Hello everyone, 0.15 is here.This update marks the closure of the open playtest. From now on, the demo will take his place and playtest is gonna be in private access only. (Come ask for it in the discord!)This update add the long awaited infinite mode and more QoL, as well as content and bug fixing.The demo contains Kali (and Ampyre when the Fest is gonna start) as well as 17 achievements and 2 difficulties per character. It’s a big demo yes, but still a tiny fraction of what the full game is go","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T15:06:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262701959","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4212830-1838407329259230","game_id":"steam-4212830","kind":"update","title":"Playtest update 0.14.1 is out!","summary":"Update 0.14.1 is here !This balance a few cards, characters and enemies, as well as adding a few contents here and there. Of course, there is also a few bug fixing.To be fair, this patch was supposed to be WAY smaller, but playtesters found a lot of things.Balance changes:Precise Hit, Divergence and Deviation now act based on the color of the card, not a specific one.Deadlock now have more regeneration from (Regen 2 to Regen 6)Spore can now do “Nothing”, they do it more often than other enemies,","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-17T11:25:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329259230","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4212830-1836506165568645","game_id":"steam-4212830","kind":"update","title":"PLAYTEST UPDATE 14 IS OUT!","summary":"Hello everyone, 0.14.0 is here, this is the final big update before the release of the game in late October/early November 2026.(Yes the cover image is saying \"The binding of Void Nebula\" read the changelog and you will understand)IMPORTANT:This update makes the game nearly completely playable, as such, the playtest feature will, in early September, go offline. The game is set to release in late October early November for 8€ and a demo will be available during the next Steam Fest.Join the discor","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-02T17:19:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165568645","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4212830-1832065502815088","game_id":"steam-4212830","kind":"announcement","title":"Discover the playtest right now!","summary":"Hello dear players.As of the 8th of May, 2026, the game is now 70% complete I would say, the last tasks are all about unlocks and progression and of course, polishing the game.In the next few months, the playtest will come to an end before the demo release and only a few players are going to be able to play the full game in advance. The game is set to release in October 2026, right after the Steam Next Fest.So, before that, why not play the game right now? The playtest is open to anyone and any ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-08T12:46:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832065502815088","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4212830":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:49:03Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T01:49:02Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4212830":"2026-10-26T01:49:03Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4212830":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:49:02Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T01:49:02Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5211460":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:49:03Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T01:49:03Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4212830","app_id":4212830,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:30Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"2bcdbd2c79bed73cc435dde7b405df9fc33242d01da7cdb05cd5aee05fadb26b","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Create, customize and fuse every card in this sci-fi roguelite deckbuilder where you battle foes, stack absurd items, and drag your handmade deck to the heart of the Nebula.","publishers":[{"name":"Cielesis","creator_clan_account_id":46293263}],"developers":[{"name":"Cielesis","creator_clan_account_id":46293263}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1798704000,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_month"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Void Nebula - Demo Trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1788792080","trailer_category":0,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"4212830/1214402251/b7